## Reference: Key File Structures

### Exec Progress File — `DOU_Trend` Sheet Vertical Layout

| Row Range | Content |
|---|---|
| Row 1 | Build labels (one per 46-column block, in the Battery Adjusted column) |
| Row 2 | Column headers |
| Row 3–31 | Per-UC data (29 UCs) |
| Row 32 | `DoU Current` — weighted sum |
| Row 35–63 | KNP Baseline reference |
| Row 66–94 | Projection target |
| Row 97–125 | Hawi − Projection delta |

### Weighted Sum Formula

```
DoU_Current[rail] = Σ (weight_i × value_i)   for all UCs where Battery Adjusted != 0
```

> **Note**: This is a raw weighted sum, NOT a weighted average. Do not divide by total weight.

### Build Label Convention

```
M<build_number>_<date>
Examples:
  M446_AU205   — Build 00446, AU205 variant
  M446_0226    — Build 00446, Feb 26 run
  M510_0317    — Build 00510, Mar 17 run
```

### Server Path Pattern

```
\\grilled\ptt_china_la_golden\PT\HAWI\
  Hawi.LA.1.0-<build_number>-PERF.<variant>\
    PowerFtrace\
      SM8975_GDoUv6_Power_Breakdown_template_v2 (Output).xlsx
```

### Reference Script

Run interactively (will prompt for path and label):
```cmd
python Execution/append_build.py
```

Or with command-line arguments:
```cmd
python Execution/append_build.py "<PowerFtrace_path>" <build_label>